To address the path selection inconsistencies between EBGP and IBGP-learned IPv6 labeled routes for 6PE traffic, configure the BGP decision process to treat EBGP and IBGP routes equally for labeled IPv6 prefixes:

```cli
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ebgp-ibgp-equal label-ipv6
```

This configuration ensures the BGP best-path algorithm evaluates external and internal IPv6 labeled routes with equal preference when establishing the LFIB, resolving the inconsistency during your dual-stack migration.
