To ensure your Nokia 7750 SR routers interpret legacy EVPN routes without the BGP encapsulation extended community as VXLAN encapsulated, configure the following:

```cli
configure router bgp group "GROUP_NAME" 
    def-recv-evpn-encap vxlan
exit
```

Replace `"GROUP_NAME"` with the appropriate BGP group name for your EVPN peers. This setting applies to all neighbors within the specified group. For neighbor-specific configurations, use:

```cli
configure router bgp group "GROUP_NAME" neighbor "IP_ADDRESS" 
    def-recv-evpn-encap vxlan
exit
```

Replace `"IP_ADDRESS"` with the neighbor's address. This ensures routes without explicit encapsulation communities default to VXLAN.
