To ensure consistent path selection for IPv6-labeled unicast routes across both EBGP and IBGP peers on Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure the BGP best path selection to treat EBGP and IBGP paths equally. Use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            ebgp-ibgp-equal label-ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration modifies the BGP best path algorithm to ignore the preference between EBGP and IBGP routes specifically for labeled IPv6 prefixes, enabling uniform path evaluation.
