"During a recent core network upgrade involving Huawei NE40E routers, we're encountering issues with BGP next-hop reachability for unlabeled IPv6 prefixes when leveraging shortcut tunnels. What would be the recommended approach to properly implement next-hop resolution in this scenario to ensure seamless forwarding without requiring explicit labels?"

