User Request:  
"During a recent MPLS VPN deployment, we encountered a situation where certain VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6 routes weren't being properly processed because they weren't associated with any VPRN instances. What's the recommended approach for setting up next-hop resolution parameters on Nokia 7750 SR routers to ensure proper handling of these orphaned VPN routes while maintaining forwarding correctness?"

Retrieved Reference Content (from the configuration manual):  
{
