## Proposed answer:
To implement MD5-based session protection for all BGP peering using the keychain "BGP_SECURE_KEYS", apply the following configuration globally to ensure it covers existing and future BGP neighbors:

```cli
configure router bgp
    auth-keychain "BGP_SECURE_KEYS"
