## Proposed answer:
To activate enhanced BGP error handling with non-disruptive UPDATE message fault tolerance, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    error-handling
        update-fault-tolerance
    exit
exit
```

This sequence enables `update-fault-tolerance` under the global BGP error-handling context. The change takes effect immediately without resetting peer sessions and applies to all BGP peers.
