To address the issue of BGP path selection being unnecessarily influenced by router ID comparisons in your IPv6 multicast VPN deployment, configure the following on your Nokia 7750 SR:

```cli
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv6
exit
