This command modifies the BGP best-path selection process for multicast VPN IPv6 routes. When paths are otherwise equivalent, the router ID comparison step is skipped, preventing unnecessary path changes between redundant PEs. Existing best paths are retained even if a new path arrives with a lower router ID.
