"We're rolling out multicast services over IPv6 in our MVPN environment using Nokia 7750 SR routers and need to ensure redundant path advertisement. What's the proper way to adjust the route advertisement settings so each PE router can propagate up to three distinct paths for the same multicast VPN prefix while also enabling the capability to accept multiple routes for optimal path selection?"

