"During a multicast VPN IPv6 deployment on Nokia 7750 SR routers, we need to ensure optimal path diversity for redundancy and load balancing. What's the recommended approach to enable the advertisement of up to three distinct BGP paths per prefix while simultaneously negotiating multipath reception capabilities with peers?"

