- Apply selectively per peer group or individual neighbor
- Combine with `send-to-ebgp` if transmitting modified bandwidth metrics
- Use `add-to-received-ebgp` to inject bandwidth communities on ingress

For traffic engineering adjustments, combine this with route policies that manipulate bandwidth values before route selection.
