To configure next-hop resolution parameters for labeled unicast routes on your Nokia 7750 SR routers, use the following CLI hierarchy and commands:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family label-ipv4
                        resolution-filter
                            sr-policy
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

**Key Details:**
1. **Hierarchy Path:**  
   `config>router>bgp>next-hop-resolution>labeled-routes>transport-tunnel>family label-ipv4>resolution-filter`

2. **Address Family:**  
