To enable entropy labels for BGP tunnels and improve load-balancing efficiency without disrupting existing labeled unicast routes, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    override-tunnel-elc
```

This command enables entropy label capability (ELC) specifically for BGP tunnels, ensuring optimal load distribution across the MPLS core while maintaining existing labeled unicast route operations.
