To ensure uninterrupted forwarding for IPv6 flows during BGP restarts on your Nokia 7750 SR platform, implement the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        stale-routes-time 3600
        restart-time 4095
        enable-notification
    exit
```

### Explanation:
1. **`graceful-restart`**: Enables BGP graceful restart globally, supporting helper functionality for all address families including `flow-ipv6`.
2. **`stale-routes-time 3600`**: Preserves stale routes for up to 3600 seconds (1 hour) during neighbor restarts, accommodating extended convergence.
3. **`restart-time 4095`**: Advertises a maximum restart duration to peers, allowing sufficient time for control plane recovery.
4. **`enable-notification`**: Ensures graceful restart procedures trigger even during NOTIFICATION-based session resets.

This configuration maintains IPv6 flow forwarding during BGP restarts while accounting for prolonged convergence during maintenance.
