To resolve path MTU discovery issues and enable dynamic MSS adjustment for TCP sessions on your Nokia 7750 SR, enable path MTU discovery in the BGP configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    path-mtu-discovery
exit
```

This configures the router to:
1. Set the initial MTU for BGP TCP sessions to the egress interface MTU
2. Enable the DF (Don't Fragment) bit in IP headers
3. Dynamically adjust MTU/MSS based on received ICMP fragmentation-needed messages
4. Optimize throughput automatically without requiring manual intervention

The configuration applies globally to all BGP sessions. For neighbor-specific adjustments, apply under `group` or `neighbor` contexts as needed.
------------
