To apply the inbound route policy "cust123-inbound-filter" to BGP updates from ASN 64512 efficiently without disrupting traffic, use the following CLI command at the group level if all peers in the group belong to ASN 64512:  

```  
configure router bgp group <group-name> import cust123-inbound-filter  
