resolution-filter
sr-policy
exit
```

**Key operational notes**:
- Replace `label-ipv4` with `label-ipv6` or `vpn` for other labeled/VPN route types
- Replace `ipv4` with `ipv6` for IPv6 unlabeled routes
- Use `no sr-policy` to disable this resolution method
- SR policies will resolve BGP next hops when the route's color extended community matches the policy color

Always verify changes with `show router bgp next-hop` before maintenance window execution.
