To enable RibApi-programmed tunnels for next-hop resolution of label-IPv4 routes without disrupting existing MPLS services, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter rib-api
