3. Verify current ORR configuration with `show router bgp orr location` before applying changes.  
4. Primary adjacency remains unaffected as only ORR reference addresses are modified.  

This adds the address strictly at the BGP ORR layer without touching interface configurations, ensuring seamless path selection during maintenance.
