To optimize BGP convergence time for MVPN-IPv6 updates on your Nokia 7750 SR PE routers, enable rapid update specifically for the MVPN-IPv6 address family. This will accelerate the propagation of BGP updates for this AFI:

```cli
configure router bgp
    rapid-update mvpn-ipv6
    exit
```

This configuration triggers immediate route advertisements for MVPN-IPv6, reducing the delay in update propagation. Ensure the `mvpn-ipv6` address family is already enabled in your BGP configuration. For comprehensive optimization, verify that all relevant PE routers have consistent rapid update settings.
