```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 600
        stale-routes-time 600
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP graceful restart procedures globally.  
- `restart-time 600` sets the advertised recovery duration to 10 minutes (600 seconds), informing neighbors to maintain routes during this period.  
- `stale-routes-time 600` ensures the router preserves stale routes for the full 10-minute restart window when acting as a helper for peers.  

Apply this configuration consistently across all routers to ensure uniform behavior during maintenance. Verify neighbor GR capabilities with `show router bgp neighbor` post-configuration.
