To ensure stale routes persist for the full 300-second recovery period during BGP graceful restart implementation, apply the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 300
        stale-routes-time 300
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP graceful restart helper functionality.  
