To implement the specified SPF timer adjustments for OSPF optimization on the Nokia 7750 SR router, use the following CLI configuration:

```bash
configure router ospf
    timers spf 10000 30000 120000
```

### Explanation:
- **`10000`**: Initial SPF delay in milliseconds (10 seconds) after a topology change.  
- **`30000`**: Hold interval in milliseconds (30 seconds) before the subsequent SPF calculation.  
- **`120000`**: Maximum wait interval in milliseconds (120 seconds) to cap regular SPF computations.  

This configuration ensures staggered SPF runs (initial at 10s, next at 40s) while limiting the maximum interval to 120 seconds for stability.
