To ensure your Nokia 7750 SR routers only process BGP routes with the route target `65001:12345` for both import and export without disrupting existing VPN services, implement a route policy targeting specific peers or groups. Here's the efficient configuration:

```console
/configure router policy-options
    begin
    community "RT_65001_12345" members "target:65001:12345"
    policy-statement "FILTER_RT_65001_12345" 
        entry 10
            from community "RT_65001_12345"
            action accept
        exit
        entry 20
            action reject
        exit
    exit
    commit
exit
